<title>SOUTH AFRICA: STANDARD APPOINTS NEW FINANCIAL SERVICES GM.</title>
<headline>STANDARD APPOINTS NEW FINANCIAL SERVICES GM.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Bank Investment Corp announced on Wednesday that it had appointed Alan van Biljon as senior general manager, Group Financial Services.</p>
<p>Van Biljon, former financial director of Kersaf Investments and Sun International, will succeed Henry Shaw who is leaving the group, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
